    "identifier": "ranton-storm-release-lightning-splash",
    "description": "<p>You conjure a bubble of Lightning at a point you can see within range. The bubble explodes filling a 20-foot cube. Creatures within range, must make a Constitution saving throw, taking 5d6 Lightning damage and being Shocked on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one and no additional effects.</p>\n<p>Creatures who take damage from this jutsu that are marked as a Refraction Point are Dazed on a failure.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, and damage by 2d8.</p>",
